<title>JAPAN: Hikari Tsushin plans share split.</title>
<headline>Hikari Tsushin plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hikari Tsushin Co Ltd said on Tuesday it planned a 1.5-for-1 share split on October 17, for shareholders as of August 31.</p>
</text>
